## ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
## nexus | ItacaChamber.tl208.config.mac
##
## Template. The job script replaces @SEED@, @START_ID@ and @OUTPUT@.
## 208Tl decays uniform in the copper shield (region ICS, exponential depth sampling with weights),
## every decay product followed. Events are saved when the energy deposited in the fiducial gas lies in the window below.
## Written by scripts/background/write_background_macros.jl from the cards of config/background
## (variant II_L1500_ICS20). Do not edit: change the cards and write it again.
## ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

/run/verbose 1
/event/verbose 0
/tracking/verbose 0
/process/em/verbose 0

/control/execute macros/background/II_L1500_ICS20/ItacaChamber.mac

/Generator/IonGenerator/atomic_number 81
/Generator/IonGenerator/mass_number 208
/Generator/IonGenerator/region ICS
/Generator/IonGenerator/decay_at_time_zero true

/Actions/DefaultEventAction/min_energy 2420. keV
/Actions/DefaultEventAction/max_energy 2490. keV

/nexus/random_seed @SEED@
/nexus/persistency/start_id @START_ID@
/nexus/persistency/output_file @OUTPUT@
/nexus/persistency/event_type background
